ain Management\nCardiology\nDentistry & Oral Surgery\nEmergency Medicine\nInternal Medicine\nMedical Oncology\nNeurology & Neurosurgery\nRadiology\nRehabilitation\nSurgery\nUrgent Care\nPrevious Slide\nNext Slide\nExceptional Emergency and Specialty Pet Care Close to Home\nMedVet Indianapolis is a premier animal emergency and specialty hospital in the Greater Indianapolis area. Our highly trained team serves as an extension of your family veterinarian’s care.\nServing more than 12,000 patients a year, our team is the trusted choice for family veterinarians and pet lovers. We know pets are an important part of your family, and we strive to provide exceptional care while showing you and your pet compassion. Our team has the expertise to skillfully deal with any pet emergency and provide advanced specialty care for your pet with the goal of getting your pet home to you in the best health.\nIf your pet is facing an emergency, you can come directly to our hospital – no appointment is needed. Our expert team is available for pet emergencies 24 hours a day, 365 days a year.\nMedVet Indianapolis Caregivers\nSearch by Name\nFilter by Specialty\nAll Specialties\nAnesthesia & Pain Management\nCardiology\nDentistry & Oral Surgery\nEmergency Medicine\nInternal Medicine\nMedical Oncology\nNeurology & Neurosurgery\nRadiology\nRehabilitation\nSurgery\nOur Hospital Leaders\nEmily Klosterman, DVM, MS, DACVIM (SAIM)\nMedical Director\nKalen Guffin-Allen\nHospital Director\nOur Doctors\nDeepmala Agarwal\n, BVSc, MVSc, MSc, PhD, DACVIM (Cardiology)\nCardiology\nCaitlin Ashlock\n, DVM\nEric Boone\n, DVM, MS\nEmergency Medicine\nJay Davis\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nRebecca  Essig\n, DVM, MS, DACVS (Small Animal)\nSurgery\nAlice Estes\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nKiersten K. Forsyth\n, DVM, MS, DACVIM (Cardiology)\nCardiology\nKelsey Fugere\n, DVM, Residency Trained in Internal Medicine\nInternal Medicine\nAndrea S. Gomez-Ortiz\n, DVM\nRadiology\nEmily Harpel\n, RVT, CCAT\nRehabilitation\nOlivia Harris\n, DVM, DACVAA\nAnesthesia & Pain Management\nKirsten Jackson\n,  DVM, MS, DACVIM (Oncology)\nMedical Oncology\nNichol Johnson\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine, Rehabilitation\nLeslie Jones\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nJennifer Kesler\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nEmily Klosterman\n, DVM, MS, DACVIM (SAIM)\nInternal Medicine\nJoshuah Klutzke\n, DVM, MS, DACVIM (Neurology)\nNeurology & Neurosurgery\nSarah Kronland\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nEsther Kwak\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nJulie Lada\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nMatthew Lemmons\n, DVM, DAVDC®\nDentistry & Oral Surgery\nMatthew Mitsch\n, DVM, MS\nEmergency Medicine\nScott Owens\n, DVM, MS, DACVIM (SAIM)\nInternal Medicine\nAbby Schrage\n, DVM, Residency Trained in Internal Medicine\nInternal Medicine\nAshlee Skomp\n, RVT, CCRP\nRehabilitation\nMichael P. Sliman\n, DVM, MS, DACVS (Small Animal)\nSurgery\nLauren Smith\n, DVM\nRadiology\nKaelyn Stevick\n, DVM\nDentistry & Oral Surgery\nEmilio Valdez\n, DVM, DACVR\nRadiology\nKyle P. Vititoe\n, DVM, MS, DACVR\nRadiology\nShow All Doctors (\n30\n)\nPet Stories\n“\nWords can’t express my gratitude after my dog Otto and I were attacked by another dog. With puncture wounds and trauma, I rushed 15-month-old Otto to MedVet. The staff immediately went to work, explaining everything and calming me down. They gave me peace of mind and comfort, assuring us everything would be fine. They saved us!”\nPrevious Story\nNext Story\nFinancing Options\nWe understand that planning for the cost of care is important. Special financing and payment arrangements are available for qualified pet owners through an independent company, CareCredit.\nLearn More\nFind a location\nEmergency Care\nFind Care\nFind a Location\nFind A Doctor\nResources\nPet Care Resources\nClinical Studies\nAbout\nWe Are MedVet\nMedVet Experience\nOur Leaders\nOur Founders\nNewsroom\nDiversity, Inclusion, & Belonging\nCommunity Support\nFAQs\nContact Us\nFor Veterinarians\nClinical Studies\nContinuing Education\