      "address": "9650 Mayflower Park Dr., Carmel, IN 46032",
      "description": "Exceptional Emergency and Specialty Pet Care Close to Home  MedVet Indianapolis is a premier animal emergency and specialty hospital in the Greater Indianapolis area. Our highly trained team serves as an extension of your family veterinarian’s care.   Serving more than 12,000 patients a year, our team is the trusted choice for family veterinarians and pet lovers. We know pets are an important part of your family, and we strive to provide exceptional care while showing you and your pet compassion. Our team has the expertise to skillfully deal with any pet emergency and provide advanced specialty care for your pet with the goal of getting your pet home to you in the best health.   If your pet is facing an emergency, you can come directly to our hospital – no appointment is needed. Our expert team is available for pet emergencies 24 hours a day, 365 days a year. ",
